  "Downloaded files, the folder they are kept in, your playlists and anything holding a password stay on this device whatever is switched on.": "TODO_TRANSLATION: Downloaded files, the folder they are kept in, your playlists and anything holding a password stay on this device whatever is switched on.",
  "Downloaded. Confirm the install when Android asks — Ventic closes while it happens.": "Ներբեռնված է։ Հաստատեք տեղադրումը, երբ Android-ը հարցնի — Ventic-ը այդ ընթացքում փակվում է։",
